WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:08.541
[water bubbling]

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.677
- [inhales]

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:13.747
[exhales]

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.382
- HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.450
LET ME HIT THAT.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.652
- REALLY?
- I CAN HANDLE IT.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:23.022
- I AM CERTAIN
THAT YOU CANNOT.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.559
- NAH, COME ON, I SMOKED
A TON OF WEED IN THE '90s.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.061
- RIGHT, THE '90s.

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:31.631
UM, YOU KNOW, WEED HAS GOTTEN
A LOT STRONGER SINCE THEN.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.334
- YOU HONESTLY THINK
IT'S GOTTEN SO MUCH STRONGER

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.502
THAT I JUST FLAT-OUT
CAN'T HANDLE IT?

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:36.503
YOU THINK
I'M SUCH A LIGHTWEIGHT,

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.704
THAT IF I TAKE
ONE PUFF--

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:39.539
- KEEGAN, YOU ALREADY
TOOK A PUFF AN HOUR AGO.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:43.343
WE'VE HAD THE SAME CONVERSATION
15 TIMES IN A ROW.

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.348
YEAH.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:50.150
[flicks lighter]

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.251
[water bubbling]

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.920
[inhales]

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.658
- HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?
LET ME HIT THAT.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.726
- REALLY?

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:00.794
[soul music]

